00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:04.340
Microsoft sapeva

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.040
che gli utenti medi

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:05.720
tremano di fronte

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.640
