00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:41.840
letteralmente ordini da te.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:42.840
E per gli scettici

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.700
ossessionati dai dati

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.200
